
README (MIMEfield)

    Project

        MIMEfield
        Version 1.0.0
        Copyright (c) 2026 by Ralf Kilian

        GitHub: https://github.com/urbanware-org/mimefield
        GitLab: https://gitlab.com/urbanware-org/mimefield

    Definition

        The MIMEfield project is a simple tool to determine if the extension
        of a file matches with the expected MIME type.

